DESCRIPTION:Our 2026 Native Plant Sale is NOW CLOSED. ( while supplies las
 t)\n\nORDER PICK UP\n\nAll purchases are for pick up only ( no shipping av
 ailable). Pickup is Sunday\, May 24\, 2025 between 10 am and 3:30 pm at th
 e (https://maps.app.goo.gl/Uv9qrYZPVQnAFafC6) BurlingtonGreen Eco Hub by t
 he beach ( 1094 Lakeshore Road\, Burlington\, Ontario. L7S 1A7)\n\nIf you 
 cannot pick up your order on Sunday\,\, you can contact BurlingtonGreen at
  bg@burlingtongreen.org or 905-975-5563 to arrange pick up of your order o
 n Monday\, May 25\, 2026 at the BurlingtonGreen Eco Hub by the beach. Any 
 plant material not claimed after Monday\, May 25\, 2026\, cannot be held a
 nd will be donated.\n\n(https://www.burlingtongreen.org/shop/) Place Your 
 Order Today!\nURL: https://www.burlingtongreen.org/events/native-plant-sal
 e/
URL:https://www.burlingtongreen.org/events/native-plant-sale/
